      "source": "Customize the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/CacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a>. Locates all\n<a href=\"CacheManagerCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.cache.autoconfigure\"><code>CacheManagerCustomizer</code></a> beans able to handle the specified instance and\ninvoke <a href=\"CacheManagerCustomizer.html#customize(T)\"><code>CacheManagerCustomizer.customize(CacheManager)</code></a> on them.",
